# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository.
#
# Why this exists: the working tree was checked out on Windows with CRLF, which
# made every tracked file show as modified (16,602 insertions / 15,391 deletions
# for ~1,465 lines of actual change). That buries real diffs and makes a
# targeted revert impossible. LF in the repo is also what the Linux container
# and every deploy host expect.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
